{"id":966515,"title":"23｜Orchestrator范式：任务层的主 Agent + 子 Agent","content":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>模块四 · 多智能体协作</strong><br>\n前置课程：第 19 课（上下文生命周期）、第 22 课（XiaoPaw 长记忆篇）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>欢迎来到模块四！前三个模块我们一路走来，从 Agent 的基础结构、工具调用，到 CrewAI 框架，再到上下文工程、长记忆——你已经能构建出一个\"有记忆、有工具、会推理\"的 XiaoPaw。</p>\n<p>但有一个问题始终悬在那里：当任务真正复杂起来，XiaoPaw 还够用吗？不是\"帮我写一段代码\"那种简单任务，而是：<strong>完整交付一个功能模块</strong>——需求分析、架构设计、前后端开发、接口联调、测试验收，全部自主完成。</p>\n<p>这就是模块四要解决的事情：<strong>多智能体协作</strong>。本节课先讲清楚业界已经收敛的那个答案——Orchestrator 范式。它是接下来所有课的基础，也是目前工程实践中最稳健的 multi-agent 架构。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>一、认知原点：单 Agent 有三堵墙，剪裁压缩都绕不过去</h2>\n<p>第 22 课结束时，XiaoPaw 已经能用三层记忆\"懂\"你了。但现在来一个真实工程任务：独立完成员工假期管理系统的前后端开发。不是聊几句，是一个完整的工程交付。</p>\n<p>这时你会发现，第 19、20 课的上下文工程会出手帮忙——剪裁（prune）和压缩（compress）会介入，维持上下文在可用范围内。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406922,"user_name":"Masquerade","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1886813,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"00F7FE50A529D7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/ca/5d/85db4c14.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776410607,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151336,"content":"按照管理原理让ai帮你写一个吧","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1776647197,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406922,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"请问多agent有不用CrewAI框架而是用纯LangChain和LangGraph实现的代码吗？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":684399,"discussion_content":"按照管理原理让ai帮你写一个吧","content_length":41,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1776647197,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":407815,"user_name":"朱龙凯","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1554935,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C43E968179521B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/b9/f7/43311858.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779521849,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"对于长程任务，需要要求agent产生里程碑和中间产物，效果会比较好","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":407814,"user_name":"朱龙凯","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1554935,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"C43E968179521B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/b9/f7/43311858.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1779521389,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"以agnet为范式改变为以task视角","like_count":0}]}